### Diagnóstico completo
POST http://localhost:8000/medilogic/diagnostico-completo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sintomas":[
    {"nombre":"fiebre","severidad":"moderado"},
    {"nombre":"tos","severidad":"leve"}
  ],
  "alergias":["alergia_penicilina", "alergia_paracetamol"],
  "cronicas":["diabetes"]
}

